flowchart LR

    A([Start])

    A --> B[Initialize<br/>Pheromone<br/>Matrix]
    B --> C[Deploy<br/>m Ants]

    C --> D[Start<br/>Route<br/>at Depot]

    D --> E[Determine<br/>Feasible<br/>Customers]

    E --> F{Feasible<br/>Customer<br/>Exists?}

    F -- Yes --> G[Select<br/>Next Customer<br/>Epsilon-Greedy Rule]

    G --> H[Update<br/>Remaining Capacity]
    H --> I[Mark<br/>Customer Served]
    I --> E

    F -- No --> J[Return<br/>to Depot]

    J --> K[Compute Total<br/>Route Cost]
    K --> L[Rank<br/>Solutions]

    L --> M[Pheromone<br/>Evaporation]

    M --> N[Elite Pheromone<br/>Deposit<br/>Top 20%]

    N --> O{Maximum<br/>Iterations<br/>Reached?}

    O -- No --> C
    O -- Yes --> P([Best UAV Routes])